  "summary": "Selected evidence records: The CLI exposes an `init` command that asks prompt questions and generates a project with a GraphQL Config setup, and can also generate a project from an existing `.graphqlrc.yml` file's instructions. The `codegen` command runs GraphQL Code Generator with no positional arguments, supporting options `--config`/`-c`, `--watch`/`-w`, `--require`/`-r`, `--overwrite`/`-o`, `--silent`/`-s`, and `--project`/`-p`.",
